How to Switch monitor

1. sudo pacman- S ddcutil
2. sudo modprobe i2c-dev
3. ddcutil detect (not neccesary)
4. ddcutil setvcp 60 17  # 17(0x11) = HDMI
   ddcutil setvcp 60 15  # 15(0x0f) = DisplayPort
   ddcutil setvcp 60 1  # 1(0x01) = D-Sub/VGA


creating shortcut commands: [bashrc = bash (Bourne Again SHell) + rc (Run Commands or Run Control)]

1. mkdir -p ~/.config/bash
2. nano ~/.config/bash/bashrc
3. inside bashrc:
      alias change-display="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
      alias change-monitor="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
      alias change-display-15="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
      alias change-monitor-15="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
      alias change-display-hdmi="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
      alias change-monitor-hdmi="ddcutil setvcp 60 15"
4. echo "source ~/.config/bash/bashrc" >> ~/.bashrc
5. source ~/.bashrc
